<title>USA: Simulation Sciences sets holder rights plan.</title>
<headline>Simulation Sciences sets holder rights plan.</headline>
<dateline>BREA, Calif. 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Simulation Sciences Inc said Wednesday it adopted a stockholder rights plan to ensure that holders would receive fair value in a takeover.</p>
<p>The company said the plan was not being adopted in response to any takeover proposal and said it was not aware of any such effort.</p>
<p>The board declared a dividend distribution of one preferred share purchase right on each outstanding share of the company's common stock.</p>
</text>
